<title>FRANCE: Eurotunnel plans 657 job cuts - paper.</title>
<headline>Eurotunnel plans 657 job cuts - paper.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eurotunnel SA/Plc plans to cut 657 jobs in France and Britain out of its 3,500 strong work force, the Le Figaro newspaper quoted union sources as saying.</p>
<p>The union sources added the measure would be discussed at a works council meeting on Tuesday in Coquelles, near Calais.</p>
<p>Le Figaro said Eurotunnel declined to comment.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33-14221-5452</p>
